//@version=6
// SAFEST live test 2 — single far STOP entry, place then cancel. NO TRIGGER / NO FILL.
//
// On a GREEN candle place ONE long stop-entry 5% ABOVE the prior close — far above market:
// inside the +/-7% band so it RESTS as a `New` conditional order, yet far enough it won't
// trigger in a session. On a RED candle cancel it. No position is ever taken. Proves
// place -> rest (the conditional STOP book) -> cancel of a native STOP end to end — the
// exact path the cancel-by-own-book fix covers (an entry-STOP cancelled with
// orderCategory=STOP, not NORMAL-first).
//
// 1 contract VN30F1M. -0.1% close_all guard (backstop; never fires with no position).
strategy("LIVE2 stop place+cancel", overlay=true, pyramiding=0, initial_capital=500000000,
     default_qty_type=strategy.fixed, default_qty_value=1,
     margin_long=18.48, margin_short=18.48,
     calc_on_every_tick=false, process_orders_on_close=false)

isGreen = close > open
isRed   = close < open

stopPrice = close[1] * 1.05   // 5% above the prior close -> rests as a STOP, won't trigger

if isGreen
    strategy.entry("S", strategy.long, stop=stopPrice,
                   comment="stop@" + str.tostring(stopPrice, format.mintick))
if isRed
    strategy.cancel("S")

// --- LAST PROTECTION LINE (backstop; never fires with no position) ---
PROTECT_PCT = -0.1
// PnL% COMPUTED MANUALLY: `strategy.opentrades.profit_percent()` reads 0.0 for an OPEN
// trade in PyneCore (and upstream) — the per-bar update loop writes `trade.profit` only,
// and every `profit_percent` assignment lives in a CLOSE path. Using it made this backstop
// DEAD CODE (measured 2026-09-11: profit went 0 -> -6 while profit_percent stayed 0.0000).
// entry_price and size ARE live on an open trade, so derive the percentage from price.
// `_bsDir` inverts it for a short — without it a losing short would report a gain.
_bsEntry = strategy.opentrades > 0 ? strategy.opentrades.entry_price(strategy.opentrades - 1) : 0.0
_bsSize  = strategy.opentrades > 0 ? strategy.opentrades.size(strategy.opentrades - 1) : 0.0
_bsDir   = _bsSize < 0 ? -1.0 : 1.0
_bsLive  = strategy.position_size != 0 and not na(_bsEntry) and _bsEntry != 0.0
openPnlPct = _bsLive ? (close - _bsEntry) / _bsEntry * 100.0 * _bsDir : 0.0
if strategy.position_size != 0 and openPnlPct < PROTECT_PCT
    strategy.close_all(comment="PROTECT")

plot(strategy.position_size, "pos", display=display.data_window)
